CLChatANSI -- ANSI-Terminal Client for CLChat
---------------------------------------------

Included is a standalone ANSI terminal client suitable for integrating
CLChatServer in any BBS system which allow to run programs with RAW STDIO.

Usage is very straightforward, type "CLChatAnsi ?" to view a command line
summary.  The client reads ENV:HOSTNAME to obtain the host name of the
machine it runs on.  You can run CLChatANSI from the shell for a
test.

Note that you can use CLChatServer and CLChatANSI completely without
AmiTCP as a local chat system.

CLChatAnsi has been tested with the following BBS packages:

· Connectline 5.0
· Excelsior!
